From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cera <cera@local>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 14:25:31 -0700
Subject: feat(dart): generate a web stub so the bindings compile under wasm

dart:ffi does not exist on the web, so the generated bindings could not be
imported at all from a Flutter web build, and an app targeting both had no way
to share a call site.

Emits a parallel stub library whose surface matches the FFI one and whose
members throw UnsupportedError, so an app can select between them with a
conditional import. Also extends the ffi-buffer trampoline path to async
constructors, which carry no return_type of their own and so needed the object
handle's type synthesized for the shared completion renderer.
